,"explanation":"A maioria das chitas selvagens vive na \u00c1frica Subsaariana, com uma pequena popula\u00e7\u00e3o remanescente no Ir\u00e3.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7f8c-b5b8-1aa912aecf3c","description":"\u00c1frica","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7d00-9977-492f646a6c74","description":"Austr\u00e1lia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7971-913f-9afa111cc42e","description":"Europa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c23-b68b-287a69cb84f7","description":"Am\u00e9rica do Sul","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7637-8a14-a2d166e8c57f","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quais s\u00e3o os primeiros d\u00edgitos de pi?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"3,14 \u00e9 uma aproxima\u00e7\u00e3o comum de pi, cujos d\u00edgitos decimais se estendem infinitamente sem se repetirem.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7bde-8603-e7cd599a76c9","description":"3,14","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-752d-abcb-d0455f141d43","description":"3,41","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c89-b025-10f77ced2cf5","description":"4,31","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c5d-a19b-7db1857704be","description":"1,34","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-79a8-861a-bd225a7d2f13","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 usado como desinfetante em piscinas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cloro ajuda a eliminar micr\u00f3bios nocivos da \u00e1gua da piscina. O cheiro forte e caracter\u00edstico das piscinas geralmente vem das cloraminas, formadas quando o cloro reage com contaminantes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7825-b922-f49c621b9106","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-791f-b99c-492366ff509c","description":"Enxofre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-72cb-8d9f-2be373760360","description":"Carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7f52-beb2-d43956e444e5","description":"Cobalto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7a9d-aaa5-1f6ca2cf1095","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os submarinos utilizam para observar a superf\u00edcie a partir de uma posi\u00e7\u00e3o oculta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um perisc\u00f3pio redireciona a luz, permitindo que algu\u00e9m veja por cima de um obst\u00e1culo enquanto permanece oculto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-741e-b6ff-18a8ae9bc6e7","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-798c-af92-c9d60ee34013","description":"Episc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7902-aa11-49eba992acf3","description":"Estrobosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-75dd-ae6e-8aa5a5072385","description":"Estetosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-76b6-b916-2df767b1d633","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os herb\u00edvoros comem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os herb\u00edvoros comem plantas, e muitos t\u00eam dentes ou sistemas digestivos adaptados para pastar ou se alimentar de folhagem.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c5d-8ca0-8a71d0f0a685","description":"Plantas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7e96-ba90-e4e3ce44911e","description":"Besouros","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7498-b301-e1416854798a","description":"Carac\u00f3is","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7eaf-baad-a0eb0410e49e","description":"Peixes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7462-b4c4-f85f35555638","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O cr\u00e2nio, que envolve o c\u00e9rebro, faz parte de qual estrutura \u00f3ssea maior?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cr\u00e2nio inclui tanto o cr\u00e2nio, que protege o c\u00e9rebro, quanto os ossos faciais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-781b-bb55-24fac57569a8","description":"Cr\u00e2nio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7139-82b5-ab9c9d8a3457","description":"P\u00e9lvis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7daf-be08-713a8df950f3","description":"Coluna vertebral","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-735e-bd66-44e63b8677ce","description":"Caixa tor\u00e1cica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-74ae-80a8-f8ec0e243f7c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem desenvolveu a teoria da evolu\u00e7\u00e3o por sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Charles Darwin exp\u00f4s a sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural em *A Origem das Esp\u00e9cies* (1859), obra desenvolvida ap\u00f3s sua viagem a bordo do HMS Beagle.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7984-9d76-e0e1206e813b","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-722b-a2f6-306dbdd071a9","description":"Albert Einstein","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-725b-80f0-faa012053a23","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-744c-beba-1732fff8e765","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-71f9-8962-572a440d1218","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual termo se refere a objetos ou retas que est\u00e3o lado a lado e nunca se cruzam?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As retas paralelas mant\u00eam a mesma dist\u00e2ncia entre si; as retas perpendiculares se encontram em um \u00e2ngulo reto, enquanto as retas convergentes se aproximam uma da outra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-719c-b32f-4977b6b7758b","description":"Paralelas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7724-937f-fc89144860c0","description":"Perpendiculares","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-76a8-83d7-31525e64175d","description":"Diagonal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-74ec-8efa-8230b9358760","description":"Convergente","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7154-afee-8e7f4c9da721","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"As iguanas marinhas, os crocodilos de \u00e1gua salgada, as cobras marinhas e as tartarugas marinhas pertencem a qual classe de animais?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os r\u00e9pteis s\u00e3o vertebrados que respiram ar e possuem escamas. As tartarugas-marinhas precisam subir \u00e0 superf\u00edcie para respirar, enquanto as iguanas marinhas conseguem prender a respira\u00e7\u00e3o debaixo d\u2019\u00e1gua.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7625-8a46-a113608342b3","description":"R\u00e9pteis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7722-a40e-b9709e8a3cb3","description":"Mam\u00edferos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-772d-bb03-75c670705ad5","description":"Anf\u00edbios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7ac7-b8f0-90b20242fa53","description":"Peixes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-78fb-853a-14a348b66a00","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de coruja?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um \u201cowlet\u201d \u00e9 um filhote de coruja; a termina\u00e7\u00e3o -let geralmente indica algo pequeno ou jovem, como em \u201cpiglet\u201d (leit\u00e3o).","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7166-bb11-eb63a022a373","description":"Um filhote de coruja","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7cc5-ab9d-70c177de0053","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7cac-bb96-d31b93535f6a","description":"Um codling","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7284-853b-a2b696137518","description":"Um potro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-71e3-9d96-25944878f98f","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma borboleta jovem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lagarta \u00e9 o est\u00e1gio larval da borboleta; depois de crescer, ela forma uma cris\u00e1lida e, mais tarde, emerge como adulto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7254-90d4-25c5b814ada5","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-79c4-b557-998e2c56a39b","description":"Um gatinho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c53-8411-74e185aa190d","description":"Um pintinho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7892-afb6-636dc4dd390e","description":"Uma aranha beb\u00ea","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-702f-924b-9439c8e6f88d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"De que tipo de \u00e1rvore v\u00eam tanto as t\u00e2maras quanto os cocos?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As tamareiras e os coqueiros s\u00e3o esp\u00e9cies diferentes da fam\u00edlia das palmeiras, que tamb\u00e9m inclui muitas plantas ornamentais e produtoras de \u00f3leo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7869-8af9-aeb8b9792fa4","description":"Palmeira","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7596-910a-f8b26a5e76ab","description":"Bordo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7f8e-b677-fbb21353610c","description":"B\u00e9tula","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-75cc-85f6-7cafafee0891","description":"Abeto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-71c3-bc76-e4ff661fa2e6","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual fruta apresenta seus aqu\u00eanios (ov\u00e1rios com sementes) na parte externa?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A polpa vermelha \u00e9 um recept\u00e1culo floral aumentado; cada aqu\u00eanio \u00e9 um pequeno fruto seco que cont\u00e9m uma semente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-76d6-8ebf-89d5a1dcc857","description":"Morango","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-72b5-8e4b-c51d910a1002","description":"Ma\u00e7\u00e3","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-786c-b551-0368e45e52ce","description":"Uva","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-731b-973f-5079ef4e0f53","description":"Banana","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-