se alimenta de um hospedeiro; muitas esp\u00e9cies usam ventosas para se fixar nos animais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-700b-87e7-cae5aed19dcc","description":"Parasita","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7b3a-999e-e616678a84e3","description":"Herb\u00edvoro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-72b0-bae9-f1ee9ad639e1","description":"On\u00edvoro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-754e-92f4-4e7b0309ac50","description":"Decompositor","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7348-b01c-c0cb80298182","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a maior cobra?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As anacondas s\u00e3o geralmente consideradas as maiores cobras em termos de peso, embora as p\u00edtons reticuladas possam atingir comprimentos maiores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-759d-8776-47b1eeec3eec","description":"Anaconda","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-771c-b494-6480d9f89d4e","description":"Mamba-preta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7334-8d8f-5122753f834e","description":"Cascavel","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7ca5-8d42-b184d8b11a69","description":"Cobra-real","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-77b3-8090-3472e05de10e","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de figura pode ser obtusa ou is\u00f3sceles?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A soma dos \u00e2ngulos de um tri\u00e2ngulo \u00e9 de 180 graus; \u201cobtusa\u201d descreve um \u00e2ngulo maior que 90 graus, enquanto \u201cis\u00f3sceles\u201d significa que dois lados s\u00e3o iguais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-71b4-90b9-2a80be47d61e","description":"Um tri\u00e2ngulo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7f59-b221-b0295db73b7e","description":"Um quadrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7f8f-a7cd-6c5a389b63e0","description":"Um c\u00edrculo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f3-7c2b-87b9-25e