c","description":"Niels Bohr","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7f91-b6ab-ac9a1188ecfb","description":"Sigmund Freud","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7ce5-bb21-2028dc7b5d6f","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos quilates tem o ouro puro?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O ouro de 24 quilates \u00e9 considerado puro; classifica\u00e7\u00f5es inferiores indicam que outros metais comp\u00f5em parte da liga.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7089-bfef-b018f9f81d74","description":"24 quilates","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7378-b812-aa8c73feba89","description":"22 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7b65-ba43-080ba8fea024","description":"30 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7bf6-916e-e143de2bf2fe","description":"12 quilates","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7730-a180-175613201eef","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve principalmente o radar?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Radar \u00e9 a sigla para \u201cdetec\u00e7\u00e3o e localiza\u00e7\u00e3o por r\u00e1dio\u201d; o tempo que as ondas de r\u00e1dio refletidas levam para retornar pode revelar a que dist\u00e2ncia algo se encontra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7d6c-a5a0-35c8fdee6f24","description":"Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de objetos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7e7e-b881-0b051e226582","description":"Amplifica\u00e7\u00e3o de som","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7c75-847a-eef03a11399c","description":"Gera\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-779e-ba4c-7bac49856b24","description":"Medindo a temperatura","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-37f4-7aec-95cb-24cdf0b46a71","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que instrumento podemos usar para observar as estrelas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um telesc\u00f3pio cap